   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "2",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "running_header",
   "box_1000": [
    763,
    49,
    912,
    62
   ],
   "keep": false,
   "reading_order": null,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "MAHĀBHĀRATA",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    100,
    84,
    438,
    130
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 1,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "तदुदीर्णं महत् सैन्यं त्रैलोक्यस्यापि संजय।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "भयमुत्पादयेत्तीव्रं पाण्डवानां महात्मनाम्॥११॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    100,
    134,
    429,
    179
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 2,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "को हि दुर्योधने सैन्ये पुमानासीन्महारथः।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "यं प्राप्य समरे वीरा न त्रस्यन्ति महाभये॥१२॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "translation",
   "box_1000": [
    85,
    183,
    490,
    291
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 3,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Verily, O Sanjaya, the innumerable and",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "excellent army of the high-souled sons of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "Pandu, can strike the worlds with keenest",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "apprehension. In this terrific battle, was any",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "great car-warrior in the troop of Duryodhana",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "who was fearless?",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "speaker",
   "box_1000": [
    244,
    300,
    331,
    317
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 4,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "संजय उवाच",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    100,
    325,
    395,
    370
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 5,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "देवव्रते तु निहते कुरूणामृषभे तदा।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "किमकार्षुर्नृपतयस्तन्ममाचक्ष्व संजय॥१३॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "speaker",
   "box_1000": [
    85,
    378,
    198,
    394
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 6,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Sanjaya said",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "translation",
   "box_1000": [
    85,
    398,
    490,
    448
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 7,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Therefore, O Sanjaya, recount to me what",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "the kings did, when Devarata, the foremost of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "the Kurus, had been slain.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    100,
    454,
    410,
    499
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 8,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "शृणु राजन्नेकमना वचनं ब्रुवतो मम।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "यत्ते पुत्रास्तदाकार्षुर्हते देवव्रते मृधे॥१४॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "translation",
   "box_1000": [
    85,
    503,
    489,
    555
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 9,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Hear, O monarch, with singleness of mind,",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "the words, falling from my lips, regarding what",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "your sons did when Devavrata had fallen.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    99,
    560,
    462,
    607
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 10,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "निहते तु तदा भीष्मे राजन् सत्यपराक्रमे।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "तावकाः पाण्डवेयाश्च प्राध्यायन्त पृथक् पृथक्॥१५॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "translation",
   "box_1000": [
    85,
    609,
    489,
    677
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 11,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "O monarch, when Bhishma of invincible",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "prowess had been slain, your own warriors and",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "also those of the Pandava host, began to think",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "of the duties of the Kshatriya sect; and,",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    99,
    681,
    418,
    726
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 12,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "विस्मिताश्च प्रहृष्टाश्च क्षत्रधर्मं निशम्य ते।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "स्वधर्मं निन्दमानास्ते प्रणिपत्य महात्मने॥१६॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    99,
    731,
    405,
    776
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 13,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "शयनं कल्पयामासुर्भीष्मायामितकर्मणे।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "सोपधानं नरव्याघ्र शरैः संनतपर्वभिः॥१७॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "translation",
   "box_1000": [
    84,
    778,
    490,
    901
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 14,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "O lord of men, at the thought, they",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "wondered and were delighted; and in",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "obedience to their sectarian duties, they bowed",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "down to the illustrious Bhishma. Then those",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "foremost of men prepared for Bhishma of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "infinite energy a bed furnished with a pillow,",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "made of close-knotted arrows.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    99,
    905,
    459,
    952
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 15,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "विधाय रक्षां भीष्माय समाभाष्य परस्परम्।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "अनुमान्य च गाङ्गेयं कृत्वा चापि प्रदक्षिणम्॥१८॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    524,
    84,
    880,
    130
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 16,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "क्रोधसंरक्तनयनाः समवेत्य परस्परम्।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "पुनर्युद्धाय निर्जग्मुः क्षत्रियाः कालचोदिताः॥१९॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "translation",
   "box_1000": [
    510,
    132,
    915,
    254
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 17,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Having arranged for Bhishma’s safety and",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "having greeted one another, and with the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "permission of the son of Ganga and having",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "circumambulated him and looking at each",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "other with eyes coppery with anger, those",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "Kshatriyas, goaded by Destiny, again issued",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "forth for fighting with one another.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    524,
    259,
    850,
    305
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 18,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "ततस्तूर्यनिनादैश्च भेरीणां निनदेन च।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "तावकानामनीकानि परेषां च विनिर्ययुः॥२०॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "translation",
   "box_1000": [
    510,
    308,
    914,
    362
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 19,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Then to the voice of the trumpets and to the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "roar of the drums, the army of your sons and",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "that of their adversaries, formed in battle-array.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    524,
    367,
    823,
    412
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 20,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "व्यावृत्तेऽह्नि राजेन्द्र पतिते जाह्नवीसुते।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "अमर्षवशमापन्नाः कालोपहतचेतसः॥२१॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    524,
    417,
    858,
    462
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 21,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "अनादृत्य वचः पथ्यं गाङ्गेयस्य महात्मनः।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "निर्ययुर्भरतश्रेष्ठाः शस्त्राण्यादाय सत्वराः॥२२॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "translation",
   "box_1000": [
    510,
    465,
    916,
    628
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 22,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "When, O greatest of kings, the son of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "Janhavi (Bhishma) had fallen and when the",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "greater part of the day had worn out, these",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "foremost of the Bharata race, overpowered by",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "the influence of their wrath, and having their",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "reasons bewildered through fate and neglecting",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "the salutary counsel of the illustrious son of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "Ganga, came out in haste grasping their",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "weapons.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    524,
    633,
    879,
    680
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 23,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "मोहात्तव सपुत्रस्य वधाच्छान्तनवस्य च।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "कौरव्या मृत्युसाद्भूताः सहिताः सर्वराजभिः॥२३॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "translation",
   "box_1000": [
    510,
    682,
    916,
    772
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 24,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Owing to your own foolishness and that of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "your sons and owing to the death of the son of",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "Shantanu, the descendants of the Kuru race",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "together with all the (assembled) kings,",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "appeared to be summoned by the God of death.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    524,
    777,
    820,
    823
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 25,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "अजावय इवागोपा वने श्वापदसंकुले।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "भृशमुद्विग्नमनसो हीना देवव्रतेन ते॥२४॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "translation",
   "box_1000": [
    510,
    825,
    915,
    897
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 26,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Like a herd of goats without a herdsman in",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "wood infested with beasts of prey, they were",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "exceedingly oppressed with fear, being",
     "end": "space"
    },
    {
     "text": "deprived of Devavrata.",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  },
  {
   "type": "verse",
   "box_1000": [
    524,
    902,
    838,
    949
   ],
   "keep": true,
   "reading_order": 27,
   "uncertain": false,
   "continues_from_earlier": false,
   "continues_later": false,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "पतिते भरतश्रेष्ठे बभूव कुरुवाहिनी।",
     "end": "line"
    },
    {
     "text": "द्यौरिवापेतनक्षत्रा हीनं खमिव वायुना॥२५॥",
     "end": "space"
    }
   ],
   "note": null
  }
 ],
